# LF in the repository and in every working tree, so a checkout is byte-identical on every
# machine and on CI regardless of each machine's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Batch files (scripts/cargo-auditable.cmd, E7-2): CRLF in every working tree, the line end cmd.exe expects
# (it misreads labels and some lines of an LF batch file). Still byte-identical on every machine.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
